00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:09.830
Say you'll be my beloved.

00:23:12.230 --> 00:23:15.010
I wouldn't marry you if you were the last man on earth.

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:22.210
Promise to love, honor, and obey Charlene as long as ye shall both live?

00:23:22.520 --> 00:23:23.080
I do.

00:23:23.800 --> 00:23:26.780
By the authority vested in me, I now pronounce you man and wife.

00:23:27.180 --> 00:23:28.340
You can kiss her now, dud.

00:23:28.940 --> 00:23:29.380
Heh.

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:30.800
that's done

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:31.820
to the satisfaction

00:23:31.820 --> 00:23:32.780
of Ernest T. Bass

00:23:32.780 --> 00:23:33.360
and everybody.

00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:34.780
Nice wedding,

00:23:34.880 --> 00:23:35.100
Pritchett.

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:35.680
Thank you.

00:23:36.440 --> 00:23:37.650
Kind of worried

00:23:37.650 --> 00:23:38.830
about that little fella.

00:23:39.310 --> 00:23:39.810
Your deputy.

00:23:40.840 --> 00:23:41.080
Yeah,

00:23:41.120 --> 00:23:41.680
maybe I better

00:23:41.680 --> 00:23:42.500
go look for him.

00:23:45.530 --> 00:23:56.950
T. Bass

00:23:56.950 --> 00:23:58.450
shake Dud's hand.

00:24:00.380 --> 00:24:08.600
If I ever hear you ain't good to her, I'm going to call that lady sheriff.

00:24:09.080 --> 00:24:10.760
And we'll be in real trouble.

00:24:11.160 --> 00:24:13.060
Oh, I'll be good to her, Ernest T.

00:24:14.160 --> 00:24:15.980
All right, let's get on with the celebration.

00:24:18.200 --> 00:24:19.520
Everybody play a good one.

00:24:19.540 --> 00:24:22.180
Hey, Paul, how about playing something me and Doug can dance to?

00:24:22.380 --> 00:24:24.500
Yeah, something like that anniversary waltz.

00:24:24.540 --> 00:24:29.260
All right, let's do dance till your stockings are hot and ravelin'.

00:24:29.260 --> 00:24:29.760
Good one.

00:24:30.860 --> 00:24:31.700
Thank you.
